%
Let $R_1, \dots, R_z$ be the rigid triconnected components of the SPQR-trees of all the biconnected components of $G$. % indice l
There exists a bijective function $\Phi$ whose domain is the set of the planar embeddings of $G$ on the sphere and whose codomain is the set of tuples of natural numbers 

\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{ c }
$\langle a_1, \dots, a_{t-1}, b_1, \dots, b_t, c_{1,1}, \dots, c_{1,b(v_1)}, \dots, c_{w,1}, \dots, c_{w, b(v_w)},$ \\
$d_{1,1}, \dots, d_{1,b(v_1)-2}, \dots, d_{w,1}, \dots, d_{w,b(v_w)-2}, p_1, \dots, p_y, r_1, \dots, r_z \rangle$   % componenti triconnesse
