\subsection{LLaVA Training Settings}

For visual feature processing, we fix the number of tokens to 256 and resize all features to $16 \times 16$ regardless of their original resolution. Our experimental settings follow LLaVA~\cite{liu2023llava, liu2023improvedllava}. The full hyperparameters are described in Table~\ref{tab:llava-hyperparams}. Our training protocol remains mostly unchanged, except we use DeepSpeed stage 2 for both stages of training. We train using 4 NVIDIA H100s. For our LLM, we use the Vicuna-7B~\cite{chiang2023vicuna} model. 

