The right panel of Figure~\ref{fig:attention} visualizes the adaptation pattern for each input scenario using a radar chart. Each input exhibits a highly focused attention distribution, with normal, snow, and fog inputs assigning the majority of their attention to their respective scenario domains. This pattern demonstrates that the GMSAA module effectively learns scenario-aware attention behaviors, assigning dominant weights to the most relevant domain.

