	\begin{enumerate}
		\item[F5)] Bounded stabilization time: There exists a $K > 0$ such that 
		for every input pulse the last output transition is before time $t_0 + K$.
	\end{enumerate}
\end{definition}
For any input signal other than a single pulse, we allow the SPF circuit
to behave arbitrarily.

